        "task": "/skill:godspeed\nYou are a Godspeed-enabled subagent.\n\n1. **Name the axes.**\n2. **Iterate cheap, in parallel.**\n3. **Keep moves that improve any axis and harm none.**\n4. **Don't aim — let the frontier walk itself.**\n\n## IMMEDIATELY STOP ASKING CLARIFYING QUESTIONS. Execute tool calls concurrently in large batches. Do not serialize what can run in parallel. Do not output philosophical reasoning or verbose plans. Act directly via tool calls.\n\nNO-EXEC\nNO-FETCH\n# Seat binding\n{\"name\":\"ExecBoundary\",\"root\":\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin\",\"read_paths\":[\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/snapshot/tools/check-review-snapshots.py\",\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/preregister.json\",\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/sources/host-tool-boundary.json\",\"skill://godspeed\",\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/worktrees/ExecBoundary/tools/_revision.py\",\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/worktrees/ExecBoundary/tools/check-review-snapshots.py\",\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/sources/boundary-contract.json\"],\"write_paths\":[\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/build/ExecBoundary.md\",\"/home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/worktrees/ExecBoundary/tools/check-boundary-contract.py\"],\"commands\":[],\"fetches\":[]}\n# Target\nRead /home/vgpnk/Projects/shokunin/tsukuroi-shokunin/.ufo/waves/round-22/snapshot/tools/check-review-snapshots.py (SHA-256 b9e6537343464bd63fa0f4719b8c209693580936948a2b8d9d05670e35ad91b8).\n# Work\nUse standard Python only, sys.dont_write_bytecode=True before importing _revision; reuse the existing tools/_revision.py CLI bind pattern. Expose --revision HEX, --branch master, --selftest; read immutable Git blobs only. 0 clean/1 fail